              "group": "Set 1 · Construct",
              "answer": "Join $(-2,3)$ and $(2,-1)$.",
              "workedAnswer": "$y(-2)=3$, $y(2)=-1$. Plot the endpoints and join only the stated segment.",
              "releaseGroup": "set-1",
              "graphResponse": {
